[34.831299, "o", "\u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m \u001b[1mexpress-api\u001b[22m live at \u001b[1mhttps://1m0v9nn6gckq47s2.my2.lambda-web.us-east-1.on.aws\u001b[22m (1.8s cold, 722ms warm) · fixed cost $0.40/mo\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mCutover checklist\u001b[22m\r\n  1. Point your DNS/custom domain at the new URL: iso domain add <host>\r\n  2. Update webhook URLs (Stripe, GitHub, …) to https://1m0v9nn6gckq47s2.my2.lambda-web.us-east-1.on.aws\r\n"]
